{
    "title": "HOMER: Fun Learning For Kids",
    "description": "Expert-Designed, Kid-Powered, Playful Learning \u2013 Meet the proven learn-to-read program designed to help build confidence, mastery, and a love of reading through interactive learning and play! From preschool to kindergarten and beyond, HOMER helps support your child\u2019s reading journey through thoughtfully designed educational games for kids 2-8. \r\n\r\nThe Essential Early Reading App for Kids\r\n\r\nDid you know just 15 minutes a day with HOMER\u2019s step-by-step reading pathway is proven to boost early reading scores by 74%? Help your child learn to read with HOMER, the award-winning educational app for kids with thousands of interactive activities to promote independent play. \r\n\r\nOur research-based learning program develops critical skills to prepare the youngest of learners for their first days at school.\r\n\r\nEducational games can help kids increase their early reading, math, and creativity levels, all while having fun. Our games, lessons, stories, and songs keep toddlers and preschoolers fully engaged, helping them grow into confident readers more easily. \r\n\r\nHOMER includes hundreds of stories and characters your child will love\u2014from classics like Little Red Riding Hood to favorites like Thomas the Train. And because kids learn at their own pace, the app is personalized to each member\u2019s age, learning level, and unique interests to deliver the most effective learning experience possible. \r\n\r\nWith HOMER, your child will get a smart head start for preschool, kindergarten, and beyond.\r\n\r\nAd-Free Screen Time You Can Feel Good About \r\n\r\nIn addition to reading, HOMER\u2019s play-based activities and learning games for kids span multiple subjects like early math, social-emotional learning, creativity, critical thinking skills, and more. \r\n\r\nAs a member, you\u2019ll access:\r\n\r\n- Safe, ad-free, kid-friendly learning content that\u2019s perfect for independent play\r\n- Research-based curriculum with fun reading games and step-by-step learning pathway \r\n- Up to 4 customizable child profiles per family\r\n- Resources for parents, including printables, learning activities, and expert tips to help support your child as they learn how to read\r\n\r\nLoved By Both Parents and Kids\r\n\r\n\"By far the greatest. This app is like a vital studying tool for children, helping them learn and play at the same time.\"\r\n\u2013Bridget H.\r\n\r\n\u201cHOMER keeps both of my boys entertained for as long as I need. I don\u2019t feel bad letting them play because they are learning!!\u201d\r\n\u2013Arnulfo S.\r\n\r\n\"The HOMER app has helped my students\u2026 it follows learning research, praising students\u2019 efforts instead of telling them they're smart.\"\r\n\u2013Parthenia C.\r\n\r\n\r\nLearn more about HOMER\u2019s award-winning learn-to-read app at LearnWithHOMER.com\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: http://learnwithhomer.com/privacy/\r\n\r\nTerms of Use: http://learnwithhomer.com/terms/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Expert-Designed, Kid-Powered, Playful Learning \u2013 Meet the proven learn-to-read program designed to help build confidence, mastery, and a love of reading through interactive learning and play! From preschool to kindergarten and beyond, HOMER helps support your child\u2019s reading journey through thoughtfully designed educational games for kids 2-8. <br><br>The Essential Early Reading App for Kids<br><br>Did you know just 15 minutes a day with HOMER\u2019s step-by-step reading pathway is proven to boost early reading scores by 74%? Help your child learn to read with HOMER, the award-winning educational app for kids with thousands of interactive activities to promote independent play. <br><br>Our research-based learning program develops critical skills to prepare the youngest of learners for their first days at school.<br><br>Educational games can help kids increase their early reading, math, and creativity levels, all while having fun. Our games, lessons, stories, and songs keep toddlers and preschoolers fully engaged, helping them grow into confident readers more easily. <br><br>HOMER includes hundreds of stories and characters your child will love\u2014from classics like Little Red Riding Hood to favorites like Thomas the Train. And because kids learn at their own pace, the app is personalized to each member\u2019s age, learning level, and unique interests to deliver the most effective learning experience possible. <br><br>With HOMER, your child will get a smart head start for preschool, kindergarten, and beyond.<br><br>Ad-Free Screen Time You Can Feel Good About <br><br>In addition to reading, HOMER\u2019s play-based activities and learning games for kids span multiple subjects like early math, social-emotional learning, creativity, critical thinking skills, and more. <br><br>As a member, you\u2019ll access:<br><br>- Safe, ad-free, kid-friendly learning content that\u2019s perfect for independent play<br>- Research-based curriculum with fun reading games and step-by-step learning pathway <br>- Up to 4 customizable child profiles per family<br>- Resources for parents, including printables, learning activities, and expert tips to help support your child as they learn how to read<br><br>Loved By Both Parents and Kids<br><br>&quot;By far the greatest. This app is like a vital studying tool for children, helping them learn and play at the same time.&quot;<br>\u2013Bridget H.<br><br>\u201cHOMER keeps both of my boys entertained for as long as I need. I don\u2019t feel bad letting them play because they are learning!!\u201d<br>\u2013Arnulfo S.<br><br>&quot;The HOMER app has helped my students\u2026 it follows learning research, praising students\u2019 efforts instead of telling them they&#39;re smart.&quot;<br>\u2013Parthenia C.<br><br><br>Learn more about HOMER\u2019s award-winning learn-to-read app at LearnWithHOMER.com<br><br>Privacy Policy: http://learnwithhomer.com/privacy/<br><br>Terms of Use: http://learnwithhomer.com/terms/",
